0	213	Kadri Simson (née Must, born 22 January 1977) is an Estonian politician, formerly from the Centre Party, who served as the European Commissioner for Energy in the von der Leyen Commission between 2019
213	328	Early life
Simson graduated from Tartu 10th Middle School in 1995, Tartu University in 2000, (majoring in history).
