473	557	Political career
Simson was a member of the Estonian Centre Party from 1995 to 2024.
558	665	She worked as an advisor to the Tallinn City Government in 1999, later Tallinn Mayor between 2001 and 2002.
666	739	Simson served as chairwoman of the Pärnumaa region from 2011 until 2021.

739	856	In 2015, Simson failed to beat party leader Edgar Savisaar for his role after an almost uninterrupted 25-year tenure.
857	937	Savisaar won the vote of 541 delegates, to Simson's 486, from a total of 1,051.

937	1018	In December 2024, Simson announced that she would be leaving the Centre Party.



